{{/* hostwarn: the host names a planned change adds that do not resolve here ([]rules.UnresolvedHost, the rule service's hosts.go), on the Change rules preview, the YAML editor's Check and the event page's step 3: a warning, never a refusal. The next run resolves every host when it starts and does not start while one fails. Parsed with every page of pages.go and with the event page (event.go). */}}
{{define "hostwarn"}}{{if .}}<div class="banner banner-warn hostwarn" role="status">{{template "i" "i-triangle-alert"}}<div class="grow"><strong>Does not resolve here</strong>{{range .}} · <span class="mono">{{.Host}}</span> ({{.Why}}){{end}}<br>The next run looks {{if eq (len .) 1}}it{{else}}each{{end}} up when it starts and does not start while {{if eq (len .) 1}}it fails{{else}}one fails{{end}}: check the spelling.</div></div>{{end}}{{end}}
